<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - June 10.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - June 10.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to Tewkesbury Jun 109.00</p>
<p>Southampton Jun 109.00</p>
<p>London Jun 109.50/10.00 Jul 112.50</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Norfolk/Suffolk Jun 87.00.00/86.50/86.00 Jul 88.50/88.00/87.50 Oct/Dec 95.00</p>
<p>West Norfolk Jun 85.00</p>
<p>Avon range Jun 86.00/85.50/85.00 Jul 89.00 Oct/Dec 94.50 Jan/Mar 97.50</p>
<p>Tilbury Ju 86.50 asa 88.50</p>
<p>Feed barley to Yorkshire Jun 83.00</p>
<p>East Anglia Jun 84.50</p>
<p>Suffolk/Essex asa 85.00</p>
</text>
